stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Unarmed: cells connected, JP1 open
    Unarmed --> Armed: image written and read back, TP11 low, TP15 check, JP1 closed
    Armed --> Normal: gauge NORMAL or SLEEP, FETs on
    Normal --> Charging: shore/vehicle/solar, inside 0 to 45 C
    Charging --> Normal: termination (CHGFET) or input gone
    Normal --> Recoverable: COV, CUV, OCx, OTx, UTx, AOLD, ASCx, secondary UV
    Recoverable --> Normal: recovery condition
    Normal --> Shutdown: MAC 0x0010 (storage, transport) or voltage shutdown
    Shutdown --> Normal: charger voltage on PACK
    Normal --> PermanentFail: SOV, SOT, FET fail, PTC, 2LVL, open thermistor, AFE
    Armed --> FuseOpen: U2 COUT (OV, open wire, OT, oscillator) or U1 FUSE
    PermanentFail --> FuseOpen: if the failure is mapped to FUSE
    FuseOpen --> [*]: pack retired for inspection
